<element name="TLazListAspectMemInitNone.InitMemOnce">
<short>
Initializes an object instance once after allocation.
</short>
<descr>
<p>
Called for newly allocated memory. Used instead of Init; this memory will 
receive a call to Init too.
</p>
</descr>
<seealso></seealso>
</element>
