<element name="TLazListAspectMemInitNone.FinalizeMem">
<short>
Finalizes memory; e.g. decreases reference count.
</short>
<descr>
<p>
Used:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Before DeleteRows.</li>
<li>Before Move for Target area, finalize old data.</li>
<li>NOT in Item[x] := / "Item[x]" uses a typed assignment of the data.</li>
<li>No need to actually init/clean the underlaying memory.</li>
</ul>
</descr>
<seealso></seealso>
</element>
